REACTION MECHANISM EQUATION LIST
REACTION REACTANT SIDE PRODUCT SIDE
1        H2 + O2  <=> 2OH
2         H + O2  <=> OH + O
3 OH + H2 <=> H2O + H
4 O + H2 <=> OH + H
5 OH + OH <=> H2O + O
6 H + OH + M <=> H2O + M
7 2H + M <=> H2 + M
FORWARD REACTION MODEL 0.0
*** the file has more below this
*** but we don't have to parse it
*** basically as soon as the first non-whitespace isn't a number we stop parsing
*** note that some species names can be really complicated.  
*** for example this is a valid species name CH2CO,ketene yes, that includes the comma and the word ketene
*** some of the species also have hyphens in the name C4H9,s-butyl 
*** some can also even have parenthesis
*** the stoichometric coefficients can be floating point.  not that we need to do anything with them